obs Rye resolves a symlinked module's own imports relative to the symlink's directory, not the real path — cord.rye needed fold.rye beside it in pond/apps; added pond/apps/fold.rye and pond/apps/mycelium_cord.rye symlinks; aligned the app's fold import to fold.rye so cord and app share one module identity (fold.Fact type)
obs Crux proven: node A and node B from separate genesis issues gossip both ways and commit to the byte-identical order folding to supply 700 over one star; a scrambled source (children before parents) drains via node C to the identical order; a forged block refuses BadSignature with the converged Dag unchanged
obs Custody honored — dev-only, demo keeper seeds, no key/funds/network; a Cord gossiped over the wire reaches the serve gate (Keaton's hand), gate #4 (maintainer Kumara) untouched
